      </Parameters>
      <Docs>
        <param name="shouldReferToSpellCheckerLanguageSettings"><see langword="true" /> to select the spell checker locale from the user's language settings; <see langword="false" /> to use the requested locale without that setting. The default is <see langword="false" />.</param>
        <summary>Sets whether or not the user's spell checker language settings should be used to determine spell checker locale.</summary>
        <returns>This builder.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Sets whether or not the user's spell checker language settings should be used to determine spell checker locale.</para>
          <para>When this option is enabled, session creation uses the subtype selected in the user's spell checker settings. A null locale adds no language restriction. A non-null locale must have the same language as the selected subtype; the Android 16 implementation compares the language, not the region or variant. For example, a requested language of "en" can use the selected "en_US" subtype. Session creation returns <see langword="null" /> if spell checking is disabled, no subtype is selected, or the languages do not match.</para>
          <para>When this option is disabled, set a non-null locale before calling <see cref="M:Android.Views.TextService.SpellCheckerSession.SpellCheckerSessionParams.Builder.Build" />.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/base/+/refs/tags/android-16.0.0_r1/core/java/android/view/textservice/TextServicesManager.java" title="Android 16 source">Android 16 session locale selection.</a></format></para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/view/textservice/SpellCheckerSession.SpellCheckerSessionParams.Builder#setShouldReferToSpellCheckerLanguageSettings(boolean)" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.view.textservice.SpellCheckerSession.SpellCheckerSessionParams.Builder.setShouldReferToSpellCheckerLanguageSettings</code>.</a></format></para>
